under the equity method are measured at fair value with changes therein reflected in net income. 3M utilizes the measurement alternative for equity
investments that do not have readily determinable fair values and measures these investments at cost less impairment plus or minus observable price
changes in orderly transactions. The balance of these securities is disclosed in Note 7.
 
