Foreign Currency
We have internationally-focused websites for Australia, Brazil, Canada, China, France, Germany, India, Italy, Japan, Mexico, the Netherlands, Spain, and the
United Kingdom . Net sales generated from these websites, as well as most of the related expenses directly incurred from those operations, are denominated in
local functional currencies. The functional currency of our subsidiaries that either operate or support these websites is generally the same as the local currency.

