The context notes that she has over 35 years of experience leading consumer-driven businesses in industries including "beauty and retail," which is similar to Foot Locker's business as a "specialty athletic retailer."

GOLD:
Yes. She was previous CEO of Ulta Beauty which means she had to manage a large retail company that has brick and mortar + online business. So yes she was a CEO in a similar company to Foot Locker before this.

