regulatory requirements and commercial law in these jurisdictions, equal to at least 100% of the aggregate amount of all customer balances. Therefore, we
restrict the use of the assets underlying the customer balances to meet these regulatory requirements and separately classify the assets as customer accounts in
our consolidated balance sheets. We classify the assets underlying the customer balances as current based on their purpose and availability to fulfill our direct
