outstanding common stock. Our sources of funds, primarily from operations and, to the extent necessary, from external financing 
arrangements, are sufficient to meet ongoing operating and investing requirements over the next 12 months and beyond. 
Our cash and cash equivalents balance is $2.6 billion as of December 31, 2022. Our cash and cash equivalents are held both 
domestically and internationally, and are invested to maintain principal and provide liquidity. See "Market Risk" for additional 
information regarding our foreign currency risk management strategies.
