provided by operating activities of $28.3 billion , $31.7 billion and $27.6 billion for fiscal 2018 , 2017 and 2016 , respectively. We generated free cash flow of
$18.3 billion , $21.1 billion and $16.1 billion for fiscal 2018 , 2017 and 2016 , respectively. The decreases in net cash provided by operating activities and free cash
flow in fiscal 2018 from fiscal 2017 were primarily due to the timing of tax and other payments, as well as lapping the previous year's improvements in working
capital management and the benefit from the application of tax regulations adopted in fiscal 2017. The increase in net cash provided by operating activities and free
